# Compiled watch-asr helper binaries land here via scripts/build-watch-helpers.sh.
# Source (resources/watch-asr.swift) ships in git; binaries ship in the npm
# tar via the `resources` files allowlist but never in git. Unknown binaries
# are forbidden: every binary here must have a matching row in
# resources/watch-asr.manifest.json (sha256 + architectures + provenance).
# (.npmignore is the npm-only counterpart: git still ignores the binary,
# npm still ships it — see that file.)
*
!.gitignore
!.npmignore
